@startuml
title Upload Track
actor User
participant UI
participant UploadWorker
participant FastAPI
participant Filesystem
database PostgreSQL

User -> UI : choose file and submit
UI -> UploadWorker : start in QThread
UploadWorker -> FastAPI : POST multipart/form-data
FastAPI -> Filesystem : write .part
FastAPI -> Filesystem : atomic rename
FastAPI -> PostgreSQL : insert metadata
FastAPI --> UploadWorker : created track
UploadWorker --> UI : success
@enduml
